          "excerpt": "是月，帝遣牙將王峻奉表於契丹，契丹主賜詔褒美，呼帝為兒，又賜木拐一。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v099",
          "paragraphId": "old-v099-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "6559ed4bc68d171b1a6cf5a90fd827fac2b8797563e4ccdc77fcb7abd56e5b9b",
